{
  "$comment": "Publish gate for packed tarballs, enforced by scripts/release/verify-tarball-policy.mjs in the publish workflow. Every entry a tarball ships must match `files` (exact path or `<dir>/**`); the packed manifest must have no install lifecycle scripts (preinstall/install/postinstall/prepare), no `bin`, no bundled dependencies, an allowed `repository` URL, and may only declare dependencies, optionalDependencies and peerDependencies listed under `dependencies`. Extending this file is a reviewed change (see .github/CODEOWNERS).",
